      "body": "## Motivation\n\nOur self-hosted Ascend CI runners access public package sources through a cluster-level squid caching proxy. The old internal `nginx-pypi-cache` mirror (`cache-service.nginx-pypi-cache.svc.cluster.local`) is being retired, so this PR removes its references from the NPU test workflow.\n\n## Changes (`tests_npu.yml`, -6)\n\n- Drop the \"Set nginx-cache for Ascend CI\" step: the APT source rewriting (`cache-service :8081`) and the `pip config set global.index-url / trusted-host` lines\n- The following \"Install uv\" step is unchanged\n\n## Test plan\n\n- `grep -r \"cache-service\\|nginx-pypi-cache\"` over the repo returns nothing\n- The workflow parses as valid YAML\n\nSigned-off-by: chenqi49 <479148871@qq.com>\n",
